ThrownTooltipSpear: Spear thrown — walk up to it to pick it up
BaseSpearControlsTooltip:
	'''
	LMB: circular swing
	Tap RMB: toggle braced spear
	Hold RMB: thrusts
	RMB + LMB: throw; walk up to the spear to pick it up
	'''
SharedFlailControlsTooltip: LMB: straight throw; hold to repeat. RMB: spin. A new LMB click with a deployed head drops it: hold LMB to keep it on the ground; release to recall.
